摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Move and organize DeepSeek Harness conversations across workspaces. Copies history to the target workspace and archives the original.","id":"gh:1433089869","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-move-to-workspace","slug":"Stijnus/dsh-move-to-workspace","topics":["conversation","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","move","session","workflow-automation","workspace"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Move and organize DeepSeek Harness conversations across workspaces. Copies history to the target wor"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"kspace and archives the original."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-move-to-workspace"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Move an existing DeepSeek Harness conversation into another workspace from the\nsidebar."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Open a conversation's **…** menu and choose **Move to workspace…**, then pick a\ntarget workspace — o"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"r register a new folder from the same dialog with\n**New workspace…** — and confirm. The conversation"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" appears under the target\nworkspace with its full history and title, continues there, and the origin"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"al is\narchived in its old workspace (restorable with **Unarchive**)."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Install · Walkthrough · Move behavior · Limits"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Try it on a test conversation"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"After installing, use a disposable conversation with at least one message and two existing workspace"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"talling, use a disposable conversation with at least one message and two existing workspace folders:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"1. Wait for all turns and background work to finish.\n2. Open the conversation’s **…** menu, choose *"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"*Move to workspace…**, select the other workspace, and confirm.\n3. Check its history and title in th"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"e target workspace; the original should appear among archived conversations in the source workspace."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"This is a local walkthrough, not a hosted demo. A move to a different folder creates a new session I"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"D and leaves the original archived. It moves conversation history; it does not copy project files. R"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"eview Consequences before using it on ongoing work."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Restart the Harness (or refresh the Web UI). Each conversation's **…** menu gains **Move to workspac"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"rt the Harness (or refresh the Web UI). Each conversation's **…** menu gains **Move to workspace…**."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"More from this suite: Moodboard · Composer Predictions · Move to Workspace · Workspace Status · Prom"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"this suite: Moodboard · Composer Predictions · Move to Workspace · Workspace Status · Prompt Rewrite"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"⭐ If this saves you a step, a star helps the next DSH user find it."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## What the move does"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"DSH binds a conversation to a workspace through the directory the conversation\nstarted in: `Workspac"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"e.attachSession` validates the Session header's `cwd`\nagainst the workspace path, and persisted sess"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ion logs are append-only. An\nexisting conversation therefore cannot be re-pointed at a folder in pla"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" logs are append-only. An\nexisting conversation therefore cannot be re-pointed at a folder in place."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"This plugin performs the supported equivalent:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"1. checks for running turns, subagents, background jobs and scheduled tasks,\n2. copies the complete "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"event log into a new Session and flushes it durably,\n3. attaches the copy to the target workspace an"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"d checks that the source transcript has not changed,\n4. archives the original, restores its pin on t"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"he copy and announces the new Session."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Copy or attachment failures leave the original visible. If the source changes or starts work during "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"copying, archival is refused; an already attached copy remains available alongside the original."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"When the conversation's recorded directory already *is* the target workspace\ndirectory (for example "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"an ungrouped conversation that ran there), the plugin\nattaches the existing Session instead of copyi"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ng it, so the ID is preserved."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Consequences"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- The moved conversation has a **new session ID**. Links, running jobs, and\nscheduled tasks referenc"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ing the old ID stay with the archived original.\n- The original log stays on disk (archived, hidden b"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"y the default filter). It\nis not deleted; DSH has no session-deletion primitive.\n- The archived orig"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"inal keeps its position under the old workspace, so\nunarchiving returns it there rather than to the "},{"id":"p23s5","text":"target.\n- Copies made with this plugin are ordinary Sessions: no fork marker and no\ninvented parent "},{"id":"p23s6","text":"link for a top-level conversation."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Choosing the target"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The dialog lists every workspace except the one that currently owns the\nconversation. **New workspac"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"e…** opens the composed directory picker (the\nnative macOS/Windows folder chooser in Desktop), regis"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ters the chosen directory\nas a workspace, and selects it as the target. If the chosen directory is\na"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"lready this conversation's workspace, the dialog says so instead of moving."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"From the plugin market / a profile:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Or, from a local checkout, install the directory as a bundle: sidebar →\n**Plugins** → **Add plugin**"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" → the absolute path to this directory →"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"A new browser half may need a page reload (⌘R) to appear. Remove it with\n`dsh plugin --profile <prof"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"ile> remove dsh-move-to-workspace`."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Release provenance"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Releases are built and published by GitHub Actions through npm **trusted\npublishing** (OIDC): the wo"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"rkflow exchanges a short-lived GitHub OIDC token for\nnpm publish rights, so no npm token or secret i"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"s stored in the repository or in\nGitHub. Every published version carries a SLSA provenance attestati"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"on\n(`https://slsa.dev/provenance/v1`)."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Verify the latest release:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"The attestation is visible on the\nnpm package page and\nserved by the registry at\n`https://registry.n"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"pmjs.org/-/npm/v1/attestations/dsh-move-to-workspace@<version>`.\nThe publishing workflow is\n`.github"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"/workflows/release.yml`; the publisher\nconfiguration and release steps are in RELEASING.md."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Rename a conversation"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"The row menu's **Rename** row is provided by the plugin and opens a confirmation\ndialog with the cur"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"rent title prefilled. The new title is saved only after you\nconfirm; Cancel leaves it untouched. An "},{"id":"p38s3","text":"empty title is refused, and a successful\nrename updates the sidebar row immediately."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Delete a conversation"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"The row menu's **Delete conversation…** sits next to Archive and permanently\nremoves the stored sess"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"ion log. It always asks first: the confirmation names the\nconversation, warns that the deletion cann"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"ot be undone, and points at Archive as\nthe recoverable alternative."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"On confirmation the Host detaches the conversation from its workspace, clears\nits archive and pin me"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"mbership, deletes the log directory and its\nprojection-cache row, and removes the row from connected"},{"id":"p41s3","text":" Clients. Deletion is\nrefused with a stable error code while the conversation is currently open (a\nl"},{"id":"p41s4","text":"ive Session holds the log) and for subagent child sessions. There is no undo,\nand unlike Archive the"},{"id":"p41s5","text":" history is gone for good."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
